    {
      "id": "XWVM.UI.GameLibrary.xliff::XWVM.UI.GameLibrary::Library.Empty::segment-1",
      "file_index": 0,
      "file_id": "XWVM.UI.GameLibrary",
      "unit_id": "Library.Empty",
      "segment_index": 0,
      "source": "<b>Welcome to XWVM!</b>\n\nTo get started, use <b>Add Game</b> to locate games to play in XWVM.\n\nOnce added, your games will appear in the Game Library here.\n\nMultiple variants of the same game can be added (e.g. X-Wing 1993 and X-Wing 1994 GoG edition can both be present in the library).",
      "target_zh_TW": "<b>歡迎使用 XWVM！</b>\n\n請先使用<b>新增遊戲</b>，找出要在 XWVM 中遊玩的遊戲。\n\n新增完成後，你的遊戲會顯示在這裡的遊戲庫中。\n\n同一款遊戲可以新增多個版本（例如 1993 年版《X翼戰機》與 1994 年 GoG 版《X翼戰機》可同時存在於遊戲庫中）。",
      "source_format": "text",
      "context": "XWVM.UI.GameLibrary / Library.Empty",
      "notes": [],
      "requires_translation": true,
      "translator_note": ""
    },
