      "unit_id": "Dialog.ControlsUnusableNotification.Text",
      "segment_index": 0,
      "source": "XWVM has detected invalid control bindings for:\n<b>{controls}</b>\nThe bindings will now be cleared and saved unless you cancel.\n\n<b>Continuing without clearing these binding settings may affect critical game interactivity, and is not recommended.</b>",
      "target_zh_TW": "XWVM 偵測到下列控制項的按鍵綁定無效：\n<b>{controls}</b>\n除非你取消，否則這些綁定將被清除並儲存。\n\n<b>若不清除這些綁定設定就繼續，可能會影響關鍵的遊戲操作，不建議這麼做。</b>",
      "source_format": "text",
      "context": "XWVM.UI.GameLibrary / Dialog.ControlsUnusableNotification.Text",
      "notes": [],
      "requires_translation": true,
      "translator_note": ""
